Package: PANDAcore
Type: Package
Title: Core Analysis Engine for PANDA
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("PANDA", "Developers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "panda@example.org")
Author: PANDA Developers [aut, cre]
Maintainer: PANDA Developers <panda@example.org>
Description: Shared analysis functions for the PANDA graphical and command-line
    interfaces. The package is intended for reproducible analysis of Sanger and
    amplicon sequencing data, including sequence alignment, methylation
    profiling, and heterogeneity analysis.
